# Copyright (C) 2026 Antony Stubbs and contributors
#
# Ruby build artefacts. The repository's root .gitignore covers `target/` (Maven's, and where this
# module's cached sidecar classpath lands); everything below is this language's own.
#
# NOTE: lib/parallelconsumer/ is NOT ignored. The generated stubs are committed deliberately -
# Ruby has no codegen step at `bundle install` time, so a consumer of this library must find them
# already there. scripts/generate-proto.sh regenerates them, and re-running it on an unchanged
# .proto must leave `git status` clean.
#
# .bundle/config IS committed, and that is not an oversight: it pins the install path to
# vendor/bundle, which is what the clients CI matrix caches for this row. Without it a CI run
# installs to the system gem directory and caches an empty directory.

vendor/
.yardoc/
doc/
*.gem
